# Project Context

Building a CRM application with .NET 8 and Blazor Server.
Following DDD principles with Repository and Service layers.
Database: SQL Server with EF Core.

# Architecture

- CrmApp.Domain: Entities only
- CrmApp.Infrastructure: DbContext + Repositories
- CrmApp.Application: Services with business logic
- CrmApp.Web: Blazor Server frontend

# Code Style

- Use C# 12 features
- Use primary constructors where appropriate
- Use file-scoped namespaces
- Async/await for all database operations
- No comments unless complex logic
- Portuguese variable names are NOT allowed

# Patterns

- Repository pattern for data access
- Dependency injection for all layers
- Interface-based design (IRepository, IService)

# Database

- SQL Server LocalDB
- EF Core 8 with migrations
- Connection string name: "DefaultConnection"
